Extract the key information from this document.

Return the extracted data as structured JSON with the following format:
{
  "title": "Document title if present",
  "date": "Document date if present",
  "summary": "Brief summary of the document content",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Section heading",
      "content": "Section content"
    }
  ],
  "keyFindings": ["List of important points or findings"],
  "metadata": {
    "documentType": "Type of document (letter, report, form, etc.)",
    "pageCount": "Number of pages if determinable"
  }
}

If specific sections are found (like "Decision", "Summary", "Findings", "Conclusion"),
make sure to extract them with their exact headings.

If no relevant information is found, return:
{
  "error": "NO_DATA_FOUND",
  "reason": "Brief explanation of why data couldn't be extracted"
}
